'''Rotom Dex''' (Japanese: '''ロトム図鑑''' ''Rotom Illustrated Encyclopedia'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Look at the top card of your deck. Then, you may shuffle your deck.
}}

==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to the effect of {{TCG|Rotom Dex Poké Finder Mode}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but only looks at 1 card rather than 4.
** {{TCG|Rotom Dex}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Rotom Dex|131}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
* A [[Rotom Pokédex]] is an important piece of equipment in the [[Generation VII]] [[Pokémon games]].

